From: vkd3d-crossover <noreply@vkd3d-crossover.invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:12:14 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 04/10] chore(dev): add per-encoder GPU profiler

Problem: Needed GPU time per render pass / compute encoder to find GPU-bound work.

Root cause: Diagnostics only; no defect.

Fix: MVK_CONFIG_GPU_PROFILE=1 times every Metal encoder with stage-boundary GPU timestamps and logs every 5 s a ranking ([mvk-gpuprof] on stderr), render passes keyed by attachments, size and first fragment shader hash, compute encoders by the first shader hash.

Verified by: Found the indirect-count pass splitting.

Off switch: off by default; MVK_CONFIG_GPU_PROFILE=1 enables
